// Title: 7Zip Compressing Dump Files
// ID: ec570e53-4c76-45a9-804d-dc3f355ff7a7
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-27
// Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1560.001
// Description: Detects execution of 7z in order to compress a file with a ".dmp"/".dump" extension, which could be a step in a process of dump file exfiltration.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".dmp") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".dump") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".hdmp"))) AND ((where(Description ICONTAINS "7-Zip")) OR ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\7z.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\7zr.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\7za.exe"))) OR ((where(OriginalFileName = "7z.exe") OR where(OriginalFileName = "7za.exe") OR where(OriginalFileName = "7zr.exe")))))
